              "who": "fan",
              "text": "oh nice rescue cats are the best mine is a tabby named max always begging for treats whats biscuits story"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "found her as a tiny kitten back in arkansas, she was all scruffy and alone so i scooped her up. weve been inseparable since fr"
